stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT : POST /api/v1/patrols (Create draft)
    DRAFT --> PLANNED : POST /api/v1/patrols/{id}/publish (Ready for assignment)
    DRAFT --> CANCELLED : Cancel patrol
    PLANNED --> ACTIVE : POST /api/v1/patrols/{id}/duty/start (First officer starts duty)
    PLANNED --> CANCELLED : Cancel patrol
    ACTIVE --> COMPLETED : POST /api/v1/patrols/{id}/close (Planner closes with remarks)
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

